    <p>The following operators have confirmed gift card programs in 2026. The list is not exhaustive — the Maine dispensary market is more than 200 stores, and dozens of smaller operators run gift card programs that aren't prominently marketed. For the operators below, this is the field-tested guide to how their programs work as of mid-2026.</p>

